[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0678","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0678.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0925","title":"SmartWin CyberOffice Shopping Cart 2 信息泄露漏洞","description":"SmartWin CyberOffice Shopping Cart 2.0（又称 CyberShop）默认安装时将 _private 目录设置为全局可读权限，该目录下存储了包含客户订单详情及未加密信用卡信息的 Microsoft Access 数据库文件 shopping_cart.mdb。远程攻击者无需任何身份认证，仅通过浏览器直接访问 http://target/_private/shopping_cart.mdb 即可下载该数据库，导致大量敏感客户信息泄露。该漏洞影响运行于 Windows NT 4.0 及 2000 平台上的 CyberOffice Shopping Cart 2.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0925"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:46Z","remediation":"立即将 `_private` 目录权限修改为 750（仅所有者可读写执行），并在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/IIS）配置中添加规则禁止外部访问该目录，例如 Apache 下添加 `<Directory \"_private\"> Deny from all</Directory>`。如条件允许，将敏感数据文件移出 Web 根目录存放。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q4/0001.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97050819812055&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1734","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5318","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20248","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0925.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0925.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0925","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0925.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0925.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/124ab3e5e42be0a51c386ce59b3e73127df55887/2000/CVE-2000-0925.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0925.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0925.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0925.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2000-0925.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0678.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0678.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0678.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0674","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0674.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0922","title":"Bytes Interactive Web Shopper 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Bytes Interactive Web Shopper 购物车程序 shopper.cgi 2.0 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 newpage 参数提交包含 `../` 的恶意路径，突破 Web 根目录限制，读取服务器上的任意文件（如 /etc/passwd 等敏感文件）。该漏洞利用方式简单，攻击者仅需构造特制 HTTP 请求即可完成利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0922"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:46Z","remediation":"由于 Bytes Interactive 已停止维护 Web Shopper，建议立即迁移至受支持的购物车系统（如 Magento、WooCommerce）。若无法立即替换，在 shopper.cgi 中对 newpage 参数实施严格的路径白名单过滤，禁止包含 `../` 或 `..\\` 等目录遍历字符，并将 Web 服务器配置为拒绝包含编码后路径遍历模式的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0120.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1776","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5351","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20280","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0922.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0922.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511