s.com/bid/1777","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5342","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20281","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0921.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0921.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0921","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0921.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0921.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5d2b90135469e518b8bd9c7142a1d639da966b67/2000/CVE-2000-0921.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0921.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0921.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0921.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0921.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0672.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0670","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0670.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0920","title":"BOA Web Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"BOA Web Server 0.94.8.2 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向服务器发送特制的 GET 请求，使用 \"%2E\" 替代 \".\" 绕过路径过滤，实现任意文件读取。该漏洞影响 BOA Web Server 0.94.8.2 及之前版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可读取服务器上的敏感文件如 /etc/passwd 等。Exploit-DB 已公开该漏洞的利用方法。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0920"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:46Z","remediation":"将 BOA Web Server 升级至 0.94.14.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 %2E 编码绕过导致的目录遍历问题。具体操作：从 https://www.boa.org/ 下载最新源码，执行 ./configure && make && make install 完成升级。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器前部署反向代理（如 Nginx），配置规则拦截包含 %2E 或连续点号的 GET 请求路径；或在 iptables 层面限制对 80 端口的非必要来源访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0092.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001009","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1770","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5330","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36689","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2000/CVE-2000-0920.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0920.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0920.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0920","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2000/CVE-2000-0920.rules","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/db09292fb11e6e85f066b9d4f61163327f785736/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-0920.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0920.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0920.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0920.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-0920.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0670.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0669","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0669.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0919","title":"PHPix Photo Album 目录遍历漏洞","description":"PHPix Photo Album 1.0.2 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过在 URL 中构造包含 `..`（点点）序列的恶意请求，绕过路径限制访问服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的文件路径进行充分过滤和校验，攻击者利用此漏洞可读取系统敏感文件（如配置文件、密码文件等），导致敏感信息泄露。攻击条件简单，仅需目标系统运行受影响版本的 PHPix Photo Album 且 Web 服务可访问即可实施。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0919"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:46Z","remediation":"立即停用 PHPix Photo Album，改用仍受维护的相册系统（如 Lychee、Piwigo）。如无法立即替换，在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置 URL 重写规则，拦截包含 `../` 或 `..%2F` 的请求；同时在 PHP 层面修改 `Album/index.php`，对 `album` 参数做路径规范化检查，拒绝包含 `..` 的输入，并使用 `realpath()` 限定文件访问范围在相册目录内。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0117.html","http://www.osvdb.org/472","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1773","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5331","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20278","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0919.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0919.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0919","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0919.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0919.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7597ddfeff03aa9cd00b0ce83a368fad007497d9/2000/CVE-2000-0919.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0919.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0919.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0919.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0919.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0669.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0667","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0667.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0917","title":"LPRng 3.6.24 格式字符串远程命令执行漏洞","description":"LPRng 3.6.24 及之前版本的 use_syslog() 函数中存在格式化字符串漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标服务发送特制的打印请求，利用格式化字符串 %n 等占位符覆写内存中的任意地址，从而执行任意命令。该漏洞影响所有运行 LPRng 3.6.24 的系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前已存在公开的利用代码，攻击者可直接获取目标主机的完全控制权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0917"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:45Z","remediation":"立即升级 LPRng 至 3.6.25 或更高版本，该版本修复了 use_syslog() 函数中的格式化字符串漏洞。Red Hat 用户应安装 RHSA-2000-065 提供的更新包，FreeBSD 用户应应用 FreeBSD-SA-00:56 安全公告中的补丁。如无法升级，可在 lpd 服务配置中禁用 syslog 日志记录功能，并在防火墙限制对 515/TCP 端口的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0293.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-033.0.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-22.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-065.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1712","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5287","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/230","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2000/CVE-2000-0917.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0917.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-0917.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2000/CVE-2000-0917.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0917","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0917.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/db09292fb11e6e85f066b9d4f61163327f785736/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-0917.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0917.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0917.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-0917.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0667.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0666","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0666.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0914","title":"OpenBSD 2.6 ARP请求洪泛拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 2.6 及更早版本中存在 ARP 请求洪泛拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送大量伪造的 ARP 请求数据包，导致系统 ARP 缓存表被耗尽，无法处理合法的网络通信，从而造成拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击条件简单，无需认证即可远程触发，影响 OpenBSD 2.6 及之前版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0914"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:45Z","remediation":"升级到 OpenBSD 2.7 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ARP 请求洪泛导致的拒绝服务问题。如无法升级，可在网络边界配置防火墙规则限制入站 ARP 请求速率，例如使用 pf 的 `max-packets` 限制或 ipf 的 `keep-state` 规则对 ARP 流量进行限速，同时将受影响的系统隔离在可信网络段内以减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0078.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1592","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1759","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5340","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20271","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0914.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0914","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0914.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0914.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0914.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2adf3d659b2229087465cbedc27cc02d5736df99/2000/CVE-2000-0914.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0914.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0914.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0914.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0914.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0666.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0665","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0665.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0912","title":"MultiHTML CGI 脚本任意文件读取漏洞","description":"MultiHTML 1.5 CGI 脚本存在文件泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 \"multi\" 参数传递特制的文件名，读取服务器上的任意文件，甚至可能执行任意命令。该漏洞源于 CGI 脚本未对用户输入的 \"multi\" 参数进行充分的路径过滤和权限检查，导致目录遍历攻击。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，影响范围包括部署了 MultiHTML 1.5 CGI 脚本的 Web 服务器。公开的 PoC 表明攻击者可通过构造恶意请求读取 /etc/passwd 等敏感文件，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0912"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:44Z","remediation":"立即停用或删除 MultiHTML 1.5 CGI 脚本，该软件已停止维护且无安全更新。如业务必须使用，在 Web 服务器层面（如 Apache 的 mod_rewrite 或 Nginx 的 location 规则）限制对 multihtml.pl 的访问，仅允许白名单 IP 调用；同时修改脚本代码，对 multi 参数做严格过滤，拒绝包含 ../ 或 %00 空字节的输入，并将脚本运行用户权限降至最低（如 nobody），禁止读取 /etc/passwd 等敏感文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0146.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5285","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22204","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0912.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0912.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0912","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0912.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0912.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0912.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/4b74475b4552ac50c2b0e9c897e19d52aaa35c66/2000/CVE-2000-0912.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0912.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0912.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0912.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0665.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0665.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0665.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0664","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0664.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0909","title":"University of Washington Pine 邮件自动检查组件 From 字段缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Pine 4.21及更早版本的自动邮件检查组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含超长 From 头的恶意邮件，触发缓冲区溢出，从而在受害者系统上执行任意命令。攻击者无需身份认证，只需诱使用户使用 Pine 客户端接收并处理恶意邮件即可触发。该漏洞影响 UoW Pine 4.0.4、4.10、4.21 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。目前已存在公开的远程利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0909"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:44Z","remediation":"立即升级 Pine 邮件客户端至 4.22 或更高版本。各发行版用户：FreeBSD 用户更新 pine4 port 至 4.21_1；Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2000:102 提供的更新包；Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2000:073 补丁。如无法升级，建议卸载 Pine 改用其他邮件客户端（如 Mutt），或禁用自动检查新邮件功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0441.html","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-073.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-102.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/84901","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1709","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5283","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20237","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0909.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0909","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0909.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0909.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0909.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08fba6d93d7b2eb4e2149df128118cb379076728/2000/CVE-2000-0909.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0909.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0909.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0909.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2000-0909.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0664.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0663","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0663.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0908","title":"NetcPlus BrowseGate 2.80 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetcPlus BrowseGate 2.80 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 HTTP 请求中发送超长的 Authorization 或 Referer MIME 头部字段，触发服务端缓冲区溢出，导致 BrowseGate 服务崩溃拒绝服务，在特定条件下可能执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 BrowseGate 2.80 版本，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。目前已有公开的 PoC 利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0908"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:44Z","remediation":"建议升级至 BrowseGate 2.81 或更高版本，该版本已修复对 HTTP 请求头长度未做验证的问题。如无法立即升级，应在防火墙或反向代理中限制 Authorization 与 Referer 头的最大长度不超过 8KB，并过滤包含超长 MIME 头的异常请求。若软件已停止维护，建议迁移至其他经安全审计的代理服务器产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/win2ksecadvice/2000-q3/0128.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96956211605302&w=2","http://www.netcplus.com/browsegate.htm#BGLatest","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1702","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5270","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20233","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0908.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0908.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0908","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0908.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0908.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08f